request.description:
No auth. Returns the bridge version, uptime, and one status per local dependency:

```json
{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "uptimeSeconds": 12.4,
  "statuses": {
    "ollama":  {"available": true,  "detail": "Ollama ready with gemma3:4b."},
    "comfyui": {"available": false, "detail": "ComfyUI unreachable."},
    "library": {"available": true,  "detail": "Database open and folders writable."}
  }
}
```

Each probe is capped at 3 s and a failing probe never crashes the server, so this endpoint answers `200` even when Ollama and ComfyUI are both down — read `statuses`, not the status code. `comfyui` reporting unavailable is expected until ComfyUI is installed.

